    {
     "@es": "Las unidades se pegan sin espacio: **ventidue**, **trentacinque**.",
     "@en": "The units are glued without space: **ventidue**, **trentacinque**."
    },
    {
     "@es": "Delante de **uno** y de **otto**, la decena pierde la vocal: **ventuno** (21), **ventotto** (28), **trentuno** (31).",
     "@en": "In front of **uno** and **otto**, the decena loses the vocal: **ventuno** (21), **ventotto** (28), **trentuno** (31)."
